This product is a substantial derivative of:

  kyc-onboarding-agent
  https://github.com/sachithpriyanga/kyc-onboarding-agent
  License: MIT

The original work demonstrated:
  - deterministic document validation (no LLM)
  - policy retrieval / RAG grounding
  - rule-based approve / resubmit / escalate boundaries
  - LLM-assisted explanations only
  - append-only audit logging
  - mock account lookup
  - mock LLM mode for offline development

Those concepts are preserved and expanded in this Persian KYC/AML platform.
The original CLI is not the primary interface.

